color - can be accesed either name of it, rgb value, hexidecimal values, or hsl values.Also, it varies, but colo means just the overall color.
font-size measurement can be pixels(px) or em(standard)
font- family - chooses which specific font style or family to use (Arial, Times New Roman, or cursive)
font-size - how big or small the text appears on the screen (px, %, em)
font-weight - thick or heavy the lines of the letters are (normal, bold)  ex. 400   700
font-style - Changes angle or posture of the text (normal, italic)


border-style - create's box (solid, dashed, dotted, double, groove, ridge, inset, outset)
border-width - border thickness (px)
border-color - simply the color of the overall border (name, rbg, hsl, hexidecimal)
boder-radius - rounds the corner of the border, higher number in pixels, more rounded, up to 20px
border: 3px solid purple; - shorthand syntax
bottom-top - simply makes a border at the top part
border-botoom - simply makes a border at the bottom part
border-right - simply makes a border at the right side
border-left - simply makes a border at the left side